# Inspector's Gadget! (windurst 41): the reply kinds on Kohlo-Lakolo and in section 3. Level 5, fame 50; Know One's
# Onions completed by GM; Truth, Justice, and the Onion Way! accepted by GM (an earlier container, an Event line on
# every brigade member: Kohlo-Lakolo 371, Gomada-Vulmada 373, Papo-Hopo 372, Pichichi 374, Pyo Nzon 375, Shanruru 377,
# Yafa Yaa 376). Section 2's other Event lines tie with the first quest's in its #compete flow; Chamama's 553 / 551
# alternate (or not) with her script in the main flow.
# - Section 1: 413 (Progress) beats 371 (option 1: nothing); an Event 413 would tie and lose the first talk to 371. Fame
#   49 by GM: 401 (Event) ties with 371: 371, then 401; a Progress 401 would play first.
# - Section 2 (accepted by GM, the Fake Moustache by GM): 421 (Progress) beats 371 (finished with a full bag: nothing).
# - Section 3 (completed by GM; Onion Rings available): each new default (replaceDefault) loses to the first quest's
#   line on both talks; without replaceDefault it would tie and play on one of them.
lists PortWindurst/Kohlo-Lakolo/onTrigger PortWindurst/Gomada-Vulmada/onTrigger PortWindurst/Papo-Hopo/onTrigger PortWindurst/Pichichi/onTrigger PortWindurst/Pyo_Nzon/onTrigger PortWindurst/Shanruru/onTrigger PortWindurst/Yafa_Yaa/onTrigger
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-27.5,-8.0,189.6 lvl=5
fame Windurst 50
quest Windurst.KnowOnesOnions completed
quest Windurst.TruthJusticeAndTheOnionWay accepted
login
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # 413 (Progress) over 371
finish option=1                                # nothing
fame Windurst 49                               # GM
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # 371 and 401 tie: 371
finish
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # 401
finish
quest Windurst.InspectorsGadget accepted       # GM
keyitem FakeMoustache                          # GM
trigger Kohlo-Lakolo                           # 421 (Progress) over 371
fill-inventory
finish                                         # full: nothing
free-inventory
quest Windurst.InspectorsGadget completed      # GM; Onion Rings available: section 3
trigger Gomada-Vulmada                         # 425 (replaceDefault) under 373: 373, twice
finish
trigger Gomada-Vulmada
finish
trigger Papo-Hopo                              # 424 under 372
finish
trigger Papo-Hopo
finish
trigger Pichichi                               # 423 under 374
finish
trigger Pichichi
finish
trigger Pyo_Nzon                               # 426 under 375
finish
trigger Pyo_Nzon
finish
trigger Shanruru                               # 428 under 377
finish
trigger Shanruru
finish
trigger Yafa_Yaa                               # 427 under 376
finish
trigger Yafa_Yaa
finish
